    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld#directory/bootstrap-tools-processes",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Subgraph",
      "label": "bootstrap-tools-processes",
      "title": "The toolset's Processes",
      "description": "The toolset's own Processes, in bootstrap's diagram vocabulary: `render-kg-to-github-pages.bpmn`, rendering a Knowledge Graph (or a list of its Subgraphs) to GitHub Pages at a publication root URL, with each step one of these tools and the push's status and message as its output. The same process for a staging preview and a release; only the root URL differs.",
      "type": [
        "bootstrap:graphTypology/processes"
      ],
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/processes/",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld#directory/bootstrap-tools-scenarios",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Subgraph",
      "label": "bootstrap-tools-scenarios",
      "title": "The toolset's Roles",
      "description": "`roles.json`: the Roles the toolset's Processes bind their lanes to. The Site Publisher, who renders, deploys, checks and reports; and GitHub Pages, the host, acted upon.",
      "type": [
        "bootstrap:graphTypology/scenarios"
      ],
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/scenarios/",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld#directory/bootstrap-tools-schemas",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Subgraph",
      "label": "bootstrap-tools-schemas",
      "title": "Bootstrap's shapes, in Zod",
      "description": "The Zod source of every schema bootstrap publishes, bootstrap's defined terms and graph typologies, and the small readers the tools share: a declaration reader over bootstrap's own shape, release addresses, and the declared-order check.",
      "type": [
        "bootstrap:graphTypology/schemas"
      ],
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/schemas/",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld#directory/bootstrap-tools-scripts",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Subgraph",
      "label": "bootstrap-tools-scripts",
      "title": "The tools",
      "description": "The schema generator and drawn schema page, the README writers (each directory's README, and the `kg:processes` and `kg:files` sections) with their Liquid templates, the Process renderer, the release-IRI sync, the term linker, and the checks: import closure, node identifiers, bootstrap's concepts, bootstrap's documents parsed against their Zod (`bootstrap:validate`), and the semver bump the published schemas require, computed from a diff (`bootstrap:semver`).",
      "type": [
        "bootstrap:graphTypology/code"
      ],
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/scripts/",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld#directory/bootstrap-tools-skills",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Subgraph",
      "label": "bootstrap-tools-skills",
      "title": "The toolset's skills",
      "description": "The skills this toolset owns: `bootstrap-contract-semver`, what MAJOR, MINOR and PATCH mean for bootstrap's published schemas and why the bump is computed from a diff; and `render-kg-to-github-pages`, rendering a Knowledge Graph (or a list of its Subgraphs) to GitHub Pages at a publication root URL and reporting the push's status with one message.",
      "type": [
        "bootstrap:graphTypology/skills"
      ],
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/skills/",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld#process/Process_RenderKgToGitHubPages",
      "@type": "bootstrap:Process",
      "label": "Render a Knowledge Graph to GitHub Pages",
      "summary": "Render a Knowledge Graph — the whole of it, or a list of its Subgraphs — to GitHub Pages at a publication root URL, and report the push: a STATUS (pushed, not pushed, could not determine) and one MESSAGE carrying the deployed commit and the QA result.",
      "description": "Render a Knowledge Graph — the whole of it, or a list of its Subgraphs — to GitHub Pages at a publication root URL, and report the push: a STATUS (pushed, not pushed, could not determine) and one MESSAGE carrying the deployed commit and the QA result. Owner, 2026-09-30: \"render content of a KG (or list of subgraphs within) for publication to a CDN at a given publication root URL … independent of staging vs publication … just rendering … output is status of push to CDN + message\", and \"the rendering bpmn is ok in bootstrap-tools … so 'render KG to githubpages' works and self described\".\n\nSTAGING AND RELEASE ARE THE SAME PROCESS. A preview is this with a root under the release root; a release is this with the release root. What differs between them — who may start it, what must be reviewed first, what else lives on the same host — belongs to whatever calls this, never in here.\n\nEVERY STEP IS ONE OF THESE TOOLS: site.ts stages, site.ts --check and readme-book.ts --check check the staging, the instance's Pages workflow deploys, pages-status.ts checks what is served and writes the message. The skill render-kg-to-github-pages has each command.\n\nTHREE STATES, NOT TWO. A check that could not look (a 403 from a proxy, no network) is could-not-determine, and never reported as pushed.\n\nNO work-plan element on any activity, and isExecutable is false: this is bootstrap-tools' own diagram, in bootstrap's diagram vocabulary, and bootstrap's diagrams carry no work plan.",
      "source": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/processes/render-kg-to-github-pages.bpmn",
      "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/processes/render-kg-to-github-pages.svg",
      "isPartOf": "https://litlfred.github.io/bootstrap-tools/bootstrap-tools.jsonld#directory/bootstrap-tools-processes"
    },
